---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Integrated Math uses information for competitions, diagnostics, email updates, and support.">
  <article class="site-container policy-page">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="privacy-note">Last updated October 17, 2026.</p>
    <p>Integrated Mathematics is a student-run organization based in the United States with organizers in multiple states. For questions about your information, contact <a href="mailto:info@integratedmath.org">info@integratedmath.org</a>.</p>
    <h2>Information used by the website</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email updates:</strong> your email address and your choice to receive updates.</li>
      <li><strong>Contact:</strong> the email address, name or organization, and message you provide. Please include only information needed to answer your question.</li>
      <li><strong>Contest accounts:</strong> your email address, display name, and authentication information. Legacy team settings also store team names and roster names and ages entered by the account holder.</li>
      <li><strong>Contest participation:</strong> answers, uploaded proofs and scratch work, scores, feedback, timestamps, and security events such as fullscreen exits. These help organizers run, grade, and review the competition.</li>
      <li><strong>Diagnostics:</strong> contest experience, answers, timing, and an estimated skill profile, linked to a random browser identifier. Diagnostic responses and results are stored on the server; a cookie lets this browser access them.</li>
      <li><strong>Service operation:</strong> hosting and service providers may process request information, including IP addresses, to deliver and secure their services.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>Information is used to provide requested updates or support, authenticate accounts, operate competitions, save work, grade submissions, review contest integrity, and provide diagnostic results. Email updates require a separate opt-in. Contact and contest information are not an opt-in for marketing.</p>
    <h2>Providers and links</h2>
    <p>Formspree processes submitted contact and email-update forms. Supabase provides authentication, database services, and uploaded-file storage. The deployed website uses Vercel for hosting. These providers process information under their own terms and privacy notices. Sponsor and registration links take you to other websites; those websites have their own privacy practices.</p>
    <p>The website does not load advertising tools or optional visitor analytics. Fonts, sponsor logos, and the archive map are served from this website. See the <a href="/cookies">cookies and storage notice</a> for account and diagnostic storage.</p>
    <h2>Submissions and published results</h2>
    <p>Contest organizers use submitted work for grading and integrity review. The public archive includes competitors’ names and placements. Contact IMT before participating if you have a question about attribution or publication of results. Please avoid putting unrelated personal information in uploaded work.</p>
    <h2>Retention and requests</h2>
    <p>Contact <a href="mailto:info@integratedmath.org">info@integratedmath.org</a> to unsubscribe, request access or correction, or ask for deletion of your information. Include the account email or relevant diagnostic session link so organizers can locate the record; do not send your password. Organizers may need to verify the request and consider contest review obligations before removing records. Clearing browser storage does not delete server records.</p>
    <h2>Younger participants</h2>
    <p>A parent or guardian should contact <a href="mailto:info@integratedmath.org">info@integratedmath.org</a> before a child under 13 creates an account, submits personal information, or starts a diagnostic. Please contact us to discuss participation and any required parental notice or consent.</p>
    <h2>Updates and contact</h2>
    <p>Policy changes will be reflected on this page. Privacy questions and concerns can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@integratedmath.org">info@integratedmath.org</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
